  "details": "I try not to blink as I watch the screen after clicking build and test, Even though im not looking to build or test. I just want to know how big my world is. I blinked and missed it. Time to try again. \n\nHow about we have something in the SDK that just shows how big the world is with out loading into VRC? Not only that, but keep it there so i can see it and take note of it. \n\nWhy this is not yet a thing is a bit crazy to me lol.",
